// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>

// macOS Unicode Hex Input (enable that input source on the host).
// Use HOST_OS 1 for Linux, or omit / set 0 for WinCompose on Windows.
#define HOST_OS 2
#include "zmk-helpers/helper.h"
#include "zmk-helpers/unicode-chars/czech.dtsi"

// Extra symbols previously taken from locale headers (need matching OS layout)
// Using PAIR (shifted == unshifted) instead of SINGLE so these still fire
// correctly when a Shift homerow mod is held while tapping them (SINGLE's
// mod-morph falls back to &none when Shift is active).
ZMK_UNICODE_PAIR(euro, N2, N0, A, C, N2, N0, A, C) // €
ZMK_UNICODE_PAIR(sect, N0, N0, A, N7, N0, N0, A, N7) // §
ZMK_UNICODE_PAIR(deg, N0, N0, B, N0, N0, N0, B, N0)  // °
ZMK_UNICODE_PAIR(caron, N0, N2, C, N7, N0, N2, C, N7) // ˇ
ZMK_UNICODE_PAIR(diaer, N0, N0, A, N8, N0, N0, A, N8) // ¨
ZMK_UNICODE_PAIR(acute, N0, N0, B, N4, N0, N0, B, N4) // ´

// German/Slovak letters reached via combos: hold the acute/caron/diaeresis
// key (Czech layer) together with a base letter. ß and ô have no separate
// modifier + base-letter split, so they get direct keys instead of a combo.
ZMK_UNICODE_PAIR(a_dia,   N0, N0, E, N4, N0, N0, C, N4) // ä/Ä   (diaer + A)
ZMK_UNICODE_PAIR(o_dia,   N0, N0, F, N6, N0, N0, D, N6) // ö/Ö   (diaer + O)
ZMK_UNICODE_PAIR(u_dia,   N0, N0, F, C,  N0, N0, D, C)  // ü/Ü   (diaer + U)
ZMK_UNICODE_PAIR(l_acute, N0, N1, N3, A, N0, N1, N3, N9) // ĺ/Ĺ  (acute + L)
ZMK_UNICODE_PAIR(r_acute, N0, N1, N5, N5, N0, N1, N5, N4) // ŕ/Ŕ (acute + R)
ZMK_UNICODE_PAIR(l_caron, N0, N1, N3, E, N0, N1, N3, D) // ľ/Ľ   (caron + L)
ZMK_UNICODE_PAIR(sharp_s, N0, N0, D, F, N0, N0, D, F)   // ß (direct key, no common uppercase)
ZMK_UNICODE_PAIR(o_circ,  N0, N0, F, N4, N0, N0, D, N4) // ô/Ô (direct key)

#define Base    0
#define Nav     1
#define Sym     2
#define Fun     3
#define Czech   4

&mt {
    quick-tap-ms = <100>;
    global-quick-tap;
    flavor = "tap-preferred";
    tapping-term-ms = <170>;
};

&lt {
    tapping-term-ms = <240>;
    flavor = "balanced";
    quick-tap-ms = <150>;
};

/ {
    behaviors {
        hm: homerow_mods {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HOMEROW_MODS";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
            global-quick-tap;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };

        // Homerow-mod-style hold-tap wrappers for unicode chars: tap sends the
        // char, hold sends a modifier (like &hm, but &hm's tap slot is fixed to
        // &kp, which can't invoke a 0-param mod-morph like &euro). One node is
        // needed per distinct tap target; the hold side (&kp) still takes its
        // usual param from the keymap binding. The unused tap param is passed
        // as 0 since the mod-morph behaviors ignore it.
        euro_ht: unicode_hold_tap_euro {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "EURO_HT";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
            global-quick-tap;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&euro>;
        };

        sect_ht: unicode_hold_tap_sect {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "SECT_HT";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
            global-quick-tap;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&sect>;
        };

        deg_ht: unicode_hold_tap_deg {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "DEG_HT";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
            global-quick-tap;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&deg>;
        };

        csdc_ht: unicode_hold_tap_csdc {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "CSDC_HT";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
            global-quick-tap;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&cs_dc>;
        };

        cstc_ht: unicode_hold_tap_cstc {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "CSTC_HT";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
            global-quick-tap;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&cs_tc>;
        };

        csur_ht: unicode_hold_tap_csur {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "CSUR_HT";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
            global-quick-tap;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&cs_ur>;
        };

        csnc_ht: unicode_hold_tap_csnc {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "CSNC_HT";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
            global-quick-tap;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&cs_nc>;
        };
    };

    // German/Slovak accented letters: hold the accent key (Czech layer) together
    // with the base letter. Key-positions are physical slots, so these are keyed
    // by the letter's Base-layer position: diaer=23(C), acute=22(X), caron=21(Z),
    // A=10, O=8, U=6, L=18, R=3. Restricted to the Czech layer so an ordinary
    // same-hand roll on Base (e.g. typing "ca") can't misfire the combo.
    combos {
        compatible = "zmk,combos";

        combo_a_dia {
            timeout-ms = <50>;
            bindings = <&a_dia>;
            key-positions = <23 10>;
            layers = <Czech>;
        };

        combo_o_dia {
            timeout-ms = <50>;
            bindings = <&o_dia>;
            key-positions = <23 8>;
            layers = <Czech>;
        };

        combo_u_dia {
            timeout-ms = <50>;
            bindings = <&u_dia>;
            key-positions = <23 6>;
            layers = <Czech>;
        };

        combo_l_acute {
            timeout-ms = <50>;
            bindings = <&l_acute>;
            key-positions = <22 18>;
            layers = <Czech>;
        };

        combo_r_acute {
            timeout-ms = <50>;
            bindings = <&r_acute>;
            key-positions = <22 3>;
            layers = <Czech>;
        };

        combo_l_caron {
            timeout-ms = <50>;
            bindings = <&l_caron>;
            key-positions = <21 18>;
            layers = <Czech>;
        };
    };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        Base {
            display-name = "Base";
            bindings = <
                           &kp Q            &kp W      &kp E          &kp R                &kp T                 &kp Y           &kp U              &kp I             &kp O             &kp P
                           &hm LCTRL A      &hm LALT S &hm LGUI D     &hm LSHIFT F         &kp G                 &kp H           &hm RSHFT J        &hm RGUI K        &hm RALT L        &hm RCTRL SEMICOLON
            &lt Fun ESCAPE &kp Z            &kp X      &kp C          &kp V                &kp B                 &kp N           &kp M              &kp COMMA         &kp DOT           &kp SLASH           &lt Czech APOSTROPHE
                                                       &mt LGUI DEL   &lt Nav TAB          &kp SPACE             &kp RET         &lt Sym BSPC       &lt Czech MINUS
            >;
        };

        Nav {
            display-name = "Navigation";
            bindings = <
                           &kp TILDE        &kp HOME   &kp UP_ARROW   &kp END              &kp PG_UP             &kp KP_DIVIDE   &kp NUMBER_7       &kp NUMBER_8      &kp NUMBER_9      &kp MINUS
                           &kp LEFT_SHIFT   &kp LEFT   &kp DOWN       &kp RIGHT            &kp PAGE_DOWN         &kp KP_MULTIPLY &hm RSHFT NUMBER_4 &hm RGUI NUMBER_5 &hm RALT NUMBER_6 &hm RCTRL PLUS
            &kp LEFT_ALT   &kp LEFT_WIN     &kp COMMA  &kp UNDER      &kp LEFT_PARENTHESIS &kp RIGHT_PARENTHESIS &kp N0          &kp NUMBER_1       &kp NUMBER_2      &kp NUMBER_3      &kp EQUAL           &trans
                                                       &trans         &trans               &trans                &trans          &trans             &kp DOT
            >;
        };

        Sym {
            display-name = "Symbols";
            bindings = <
                           &kp EXCL         &kp AT     &kp HASH       &kp DOLLAR           &kp PERCENT           &kp CARET       &kp AMPERSAND      &kp KP_ASTERISK   &kp SQT           &kp DQT
                           &deg_ht LCTRL 0  &kp TILDE  &hm LGUI LBRC  &hm LSHIFT LBKT      &kp LPAR              &kp AT          &euro_ht RSHFT 0   &sect_ht RGUI 0   &trans            &hm RCTRL BACKSLASH
            &trans         &trans           &trans     &kp RBRC       &kp RBKT             &kp RPAR              &kp MINUS       &kp EQUAL          &trans            &trans            &trans              &trans
                                                       &trans         &trans               &trans                &trans          &trans             &trans
            >;
        };

        Fun {
            display-name = "FN";
            bindings = <
                           &trans           &trans     &kp C_MUTE     &kp C_VOLUME_DOWN    &kp C_VOLUME_UP       &kp F1          &kp F2             &kp F3            &kp F4            &kp F5
                           &trans           &trans     &hm LGUI D     &hm LSHIFT C_BRI_DEC &kp C_BRI_INC         &kp F6          &kp F7             &kp F8            &kp F9            &kp F10
            &trans         &trans           &trans     &kp C_PREVIOUS &kp C_PLAY_PAUSE     &kp C_NEXT            &kp F12         &kp F12            &trans            &trans            &kp C_AL_COFFEE     &trans
                                                       &trans         &trans               &trans                &trans          &trans             &trans
            >;
        };

        // Unicode pairs: tap = lowercase, Shift+tap = uppercase (ě/Ě, …)
        Czech {
            display-name = "Czech";
            bindings = <
                           &cs_ec           &cs_sc     &cs_cc         &cs_rc               &cs_zc                &cs_ya          &cs_aa             &cs_ia            &cs_ea            &cs_oa
                           &csdc_ht LCTRL 0 &trans     &trans         &cstc_ht LSHIFT 0    &trans                &cs_ua          &csur_ht RSHFT 0   &trans            &csnc_ht RALT 0   &trans
            &trans         &caron           &acute     &diaer         &sharp_s             &o_circ               &trans          &trans             &trans            &trans            &trans              &trans
                                                       &trans         &trans               &trans                &trans          &trans             &trans
            >;
        };
    };
};
